OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Lights dazzle North East
OL,4,Aand Cumbria skies
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Lights illuminated the skies
OL,7,Fabove the north east of England and
OL,8,FCumbria, dazzling photographers and
OL,9,Fstargazers.
OL,11,FThe pink and green hues were on display
OL,12,Fon Saturday evening.
OL,14,FKnown as the Aurora Borealis, the
OL,15,Fbright colours are a result of solar
OL,16,Feruptions sending particles towards the
OL,17,FEarth and interacting with particles in
OL,18,Fthe atmosphere.
OL,20,FThe Met Office said more sightings
OL,21,Fcould be possible until Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
